      w: ['think outside the box|خلاقانه فکر کردن|We need to think outside the box.','get the ball rolling|کار را شروع کردن|Let\'s get the ball rolling.','back to square one|برگشت به نقطهٔ اول|The plan failed; we\'re back to square one.','cut corners|سرسری انجام دادن|Don\'t cut corners on safety.','make ends meet|دخل و خرج را جور کردن|It\'s hard to make ends meet.','break even|بی‌سود و زیان شدن|We finally broke even.','in the red|بدهکار|The company is in the red.','pay off|نتیجه دادن|All your hard work will pay off.','the bottom line|اصل مطلب|The bottom line is we need more money.','a long shot|احتمال کم|It\'s a long shot, but let\'s try.'],
